      "title": "&f&lSpells found through adventure&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fAlex’s Caves: Spellbooks, Cataclysm: Spellbooks and Twilight Forest: Spellbooks connect magic to their corresponding adventures. Inspect the installed addon’s JEI entries and discovery rules, then choose one spell to pursue.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fLet your current workshop access and combat readiness guide the destination.",
